bond: unknown command "lacp_strict"?
Usage: ... bond [ mode BONDMODE ] [ active_slave SLAVE_DEV ]
                [ clear_active_slave ] [ miimon MIIMON ]
                [ updelay UPDELAY ] [ downdelay DOWNDELAY ]
                [ peer_notify_delay DELAY ]
